<title>UK: One Jan 1-3 Brent date kept, second clocked.</title>
<headline>One Jan 1-3 Brent date kept, second clocked.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>One Brent cargo was kept voluntarily by the five o'clock deadline on Tuesday and a second was left unclaimed, traders said.</p>
<p>BP kept at Jan 1-3 cargo and Esso was clocked with a cargo loading in the same period.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 17 542 8060</p>
</text>
